#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1354
msgid "Query or set the default value of the specified option(s) in *style*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1356
msgid ""
"Each key in *kw* is an option and each value is a string identifying the "
"value for that option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1359
msgid ""
"For example, to change every default button to be a flat button with some "
"padding and a different background color::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1362
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"ttk.Style().configure(\"TButton\", padding=6, relief=\"flat\",\n"
"   background=\"#ccc\")\n"
"\n"
"btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Sample\")\n"
"btn.pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"ttk.Style().configure(\"TButton\", padding=6, relief=\"flat\",\n"
"   background=\"#ccc\")\n"
"\n"
"btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Sample\")\n"
"btn.pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1378
msgid "Query or sets dynamic values of the specified option(s) in *style*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1380
msgid ""
"Each key in *kw* is an option and each value should be a list or a tuple "
"(usually) containing statespecs grouped in tuples, lists, or some other "
"preference. A statespec is a compound of one or more states and then a value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1385
msgid "An example may make it more understandable::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1387
msgid ""
"import tkinter\n"
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.map(\"C.TButton\",\n"
"    foreground=[('pressed', 'red'), ('active', 'blue')],\n"
"    background=[('pressed', '!disabled', 'black'), ('active', 'white')]\n"
"    )\n"
"\n"
"colored_btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Test\", style=\"C.TButton\").pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"import tkinter\n"
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.map(\"C.TButton\",\n"
"    foreground=[('pressed', 'red'), ('active', 'blue')],\n"
"    background=[('pressed', '!disabled', 'black'), ('active', 'white')]\n"
"    )\n"
"\n"
"colored_btn = ttk.Button(text=\"Test\", style=\"C.TButton\").pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1403
msgid ""
"Note that the order of the (states, value) sequences for an option does "
"matter, if the order is changed to ``[('active', 'blue'), ('pressed', "
"'red')]`` in the foreground option, for example, the result would be a blue "
"foreground when the widget were in active or pressed states."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1408
msgid ""
"When called to query the map (without specifying values to set), it returns "
"a dictionary mapping each option to its list of statespecs."
msgstr ""
"若在呼叫時查詢對映（未指定要設定的值），則會回傳一個字典，將每個選項對映到其"
"狀態規格（statespec）串列。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1411
msgid "The value returned when querying the map was corrected."
msgstr "修正了查詢對映時回傳的值。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1417
msgid "Returns the value specified for *option* in *style*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1419
msgid ""
"If *state* is specified, it is expected to be a sequence of one or more "
"states. If the *default* argument is set, it is used as a fallback value in "
"case no specification for option is found."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1423
msgid "To check what font a Button uses by default::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1425
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"print(ttk.Style().lookup(\"TButton\", \"font\"))"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"\n"
"print(ttk.Style().lookup(\"TButton\", \"font\"))"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1432
msgid ""
"Define the widget layout for given *style*. If *layoutspec* is omitted, "
"return the layout specification for given style."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1435
msgid ""
"*layoutspec*, if specified, is expected to be a list or some other sequence "
"type (excluding strings), where each item should be a tuple and the first "
"item is the layout name and the second item should have the format described "
"in `Layouts`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1440
msgid ""
"To understand the format, see the following example (it is not intended to "
"do anything useful)::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1443
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.layout(\"TMenubutton\", [\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.background\", None),\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.button\", {\"children\":\n"
"       [(\"Menubutton.focus\", {\"children\":\n"
"           [(\"Menubutton.padding\", {\"children\":\n"
"               [(\"Menubutton.label\", {\"side\": \"left\", \"expand\": "
"1})]\n"
"           })]\n"
"       })]\n"
"   }),\n"
"])\n"
"\n"
"mbtn = ttk.Menubutton(text='Text')\n"
"mbtn.pack()\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.layout(\"TMenubutton\", [\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.background\", None),\n"
"   (\"Menubutton.button\", {\"children\":\n"
"       [(\"Menubutton.focus\", {\"children\":\n"
"           [(\"Menubutton.padding\", {\"children\":\n"
"               [(\"Menubutton.label\", {\"side\": \"left\", \"expand\": "
"1})]\n"
"           })]\n"
"       })]\n"
"   }),\n"
"])\n"
"\n"
"mbtn = ttk.Menubutton(text='Text')\n"
"mbtn.pack()\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1467
msgid ""
"Create a new element in the current theme, of the given *etype* which is "
"expected to be either \"image\", \"from\" or \"vsapi\". The latter is only "
"available in Tk 8.6 on Windows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1471
msgid ""
"If \"image\" is used, *args* should contain the default image name followed "
"by statespec/value pairs (this is the imagespec), and *kw* may have the "
"following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1475
msgid "border=padding"
msgstr "border=padding"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1476
msgid ""
"padding is a list of up to four integers, specifying the left, top, right, "
"and bottom borders, respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1479 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1553
msgid "height=height"
msgstr "height=height"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1480
msgid ""
"Specifies a minimum height for the element. If less than zero, the base "
"image's height is used as a default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1483 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1527
msgid "padding=padding"
msgstr "padding=padding"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1484
msgid ""
"Specifies the element's interior padding. Defaults to border's value if not "
"specified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1487
msgid "sticky=spec"
msgstr "sticky=spec"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1488
msgid ""
"Specifies how the image is placed within the final parcel. spec contains "
"zero or more characters \"n\", \"s\", \"w\", or \"e\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1491 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1545
msgid "width=width"
msgstr "width=width"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1492
msgid ""
"Specifies a minimum width for the element. If less than zero, the base "
"image's width is used as a default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1495 ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1512
#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1557
msgid "Example::"
msgstr "範例： ::"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1497
msgid ""
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-pressed.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-active.png')\n"
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('Button.button', 'image',\n"
"                     img1, ('pressed', img2), ('active', img3),\n"
"                     border=(2, 4), sticky='we')"
msgstr ""
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-pressed.png')\n"
"img1 = tkinter.PhotoImage(master=root, file='button-active.png')\n"
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('Button.button', 'image',\n"
"                     img1, ('pressed', img2), ('active', img3),\n"
"                     border=(2, 4), sticky='we')"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1505
msgid ""
"If \"from\" is used as the value of *etype*, :meth:`element_create` will "
"clone an existing element. *args* is expected to contain a themename, from "
"which the element will be cloned, and optionally an element to clone from. "
"If this element to clone from is not specified, an empty element will be "
"used. *kw* is discarded."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1514
msgid ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('plain.background', 'from', 'default')"
msgstr ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('plain.background', 'from', 'default')"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1517
msgid ""
"If \"vsapi\" is used as the value of *etype*, :meth:`element_create` will "
"create a new element in the current theme whose visual appearance is drawn "
"using the Microsoft Visual Styles API which is responsible for the themed "
"styles on Windows XP and Vista. *args* is expected to contain the Visual "
"Styles class and part as given in the Microsoft documentation followed by an "
"optional sequence of tuples of ttk states and the corresponding Visual "
"Styles API state value. *kw* may have the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1528
msgid ""
"Specify the element's interior padding. *padding* is a list of up to four "
"integers specifying the left, top, right and bottom padding quantities "
"respectively. If fewer than four elements are specified, bottom defaults to "
"top, right defaults to left, and top defaults to left. In other words, a "
"list of three numbers specify the left, vertical, and right padding; a list "
"of two numbers specify the horizontal and the vertical padding; a single "
"number specifies the same padding all the way around the widget. This option "
"may not be mixed with any other options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1539
msgid "margins=padding"
msgstr "margins=padding"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1540
msgid ""
"Specifies the elements exterior padding. *padding* is a list of up to four "
"integers specifying the left, top, right and bottom padding quantities "
"respectively. This option may not be mixed with any other options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1546
msgid ""
"Specifies the width for the element. If this option is set then the Visual "
"Styles API will not be queried for the recommended size or the part. If this "
"option is set then *height* should also be set. The *width* and *height* "
"options cannot be mixed with the *padding* or *margins* options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1554
msgid "Specifies the height of the element. See the comments for *width*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1559
msgid ""
"style = ttk.Style(root)\n"
"style.element_create('pin', 'vsapi', 'EXPLORERBAR', 3, [\n"
"                     ('pressed', '!selected', 3),\n"
"                     ('active', '!selected', 2),\n"
"                     ('pressed', 'selected', 6),\n"
"                     ('active', 'selected', 5),\n"
"                     ('selected', 4),\n"
"                     ('', 1)])\n"
"style.layout('Explorer.Pin',\n"
"             [('Explorer.Pin.pin', {'sticky': 'news'})])\n"
"pin = ttk.Checkbutton(style='Explorer.Pin')\n"
"pin.pack(expand=True, fill='both')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1572
msgid "Added support of the \"vsapi\" element factory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1577
msgid "Returns a tuple of elements defined in the current theme."
msgstr "回傳目前主題中已定義的元素所組成的元組。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1582
msgid "Returns a tuple of *elementname*'s options."
msgstr "回傳 *elementname* 的選項所組成的元組。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1587
msgid "Create a new theme."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1589
msgid ""
"It is an error if *themename* already exists. If *parent* is specified, the "
"new theme will inherit styles, elements and layouts from the parent theme. "
"If *settings* are present they are expected to have the same syntax used "
"for :meth:`theme_settings`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1597
msgid ""
"Temporarily sets the current theme to *themename*, apply specified "
"*settings* and then restore the previous theme."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1600
msgid ""
"Each key in *settings* is a style and each value may contain the keys "
"'configure', 'map', 'layout' and 'element create' and they are expected to "
"have the same format as specified by the methods :meth:`Style.configure`, :"
"meth:`Style.map`, :meth:`Style.layout` and :meth:`Style.element_create` "
"respectively."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1606
msgid "As an example, let's change the Combobox for the default theme a bit::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1608
msgid ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.theme_settings(\"default\", {\n"
"   \"TCombobox\": {\n"
"       \"configure\": {\"padding\": 5},\n"
"       \"map\": {\n"
"           \"background\": [(\"active\", \"green2\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"green4\")],\n"
"           \"fieldbackground\": [(\"!disabled\", \"green3\")],\n"
"           \"foreground\": [(\"focus\", \"OliveDrab1\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"OliveDrab2\")]\n"
"       }\n"
"   }\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"combo = ttk.Combobox().pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"
msgstr ""
"from tkinter import ttk\n"
"import tkinter\n"
"\n"
"root = tkinter.Tk()\n"
"\n"
"style = ttk.Style()\n"
"style.theme_settings(\"default\", {\n"
"   \"TCombobox\": {\n"
"       \"configure\": {\"padding\": 5},\n"
"       \"map\": {\n"
"           \"background\": [(\"active\", \"green2\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"green4\")],\n"
"           \"fieldbackground\": [(\"!disabled\", \"green3\")],\n"
"           \"foreground\": [(\"focus\", \"OliveDrab1\"),\n"
"                          (\"!disabled\", \"OliveDrab2\")]\n"
"       }\n"
"   }\n"
"})\n"
"\n"
"combo = ttk.Combobox().pack()\n"
"\n"
"root.mainloop()"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1634
msgid "Returns a tuple of all known themes."
msgstr "回傳包含所有已知主題的元組。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1639
msgid ""
"If *themename* is not given, returns the theme in use.  Otherwise, sets the "
"current theme to *themename*, refreshes all widgets and emits a "
"<<ThemeChanged>> event."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1645
msgid "Layouts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1647
msgid ""
"A layout can be just ``None``, if it takes no options, or a dict of options "
"specifying how to arrange the element. The layout mechanism uses a "
"simplified version of the pack geometry manager: given an initial cavity, "
"each element is allocated a parcel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1654
msgid "*side*: whichside"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1655
msgid ""
"Specifies which side of the cavity to place the element; one of top, right, "
"bottom or left. If omitted, the element occupies the entire cavity."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1659
msgid "*sticky*: nswe"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1660
msgid "Specifies where the element is placed inside its allocated parcel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1662
msgid "*unit*: 0 or 1"
msgstr "*unit*：0 或 1"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1663
msgid ""
"If set to 1, causes the element and all of its descendants to be treated as "
"a single element for the purposes of :meth:`Widget.identify` et al. It's "
"used for things like scrollbar thumbs with grips."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1667
msgid "*children*: [sublayout... ]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1668
msgid ""
"Specifies a list of elements to place inside the element. Each element is a "
"tuple (or other sequence type) where the first item is the layout name, and "
"the other is a `Layout`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1676
msgid "Additional widgets"
msgstr "其他元件"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1678
msgid ""
"The following themed widgets complete the :mod:`tkinter.ttk` widget set. "
"Each is the themed counterpart of the like-named classic :mod:`tkinter` "
"widget and inherits the common methods of :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"以下的主題化元件補足了 :mod:`tkinter.ttk` 的元件集合。每一個都是對應到 :mod:"
"`tkinter` 中同名傳統元件的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1684
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Button` widget, displays a textual label and/or image, and "
"evaluates a command when pressed. It is the themed counterpart of :class:"
"`tkinter.Button` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Button` 元件會顯示文字標籤和/或圖片，並在被按下時執行一個命令。它"
"是 :class:`tkinter.Button` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件"
"方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1691
msgid "Invoke the command associated with the button and return its result."
msgstr "叫用與該按鈕關聯的命令，並回傳其結果。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1696
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Checkbutton` widget, used to control a boolean variable that is "
"toggled on and off. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter."
"Checkbutton` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Checkbutton` 元件用來控制一個會被切換開／關的布林變數。它是 :"
"class:`tkinter.Checkbutton` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件"
"方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1703
msgid ""
"Toggle the button between its selected and deselected states, invoke the "
"command associated with the button, and return its result."
msgstr ""
"在按鈕的已選取和未選取狀態之間切換，叫用與該按鈕關聯的命令，並回傳其結果。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1709
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Entry` widget, displays a one-line text string and allows the "
"user to edit it. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Entry` and "
"inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget` as well as the "
"editing methods from :class:`tkinter.Entry`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Entry` 元件會顯示一行文字字串，並讓使用者可以編輯它。它是 :class:"
"`tkinter.Entry` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法，以及 :"
"class:`tkinter.Entry` 的編輯方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1717
msgid ""
"Return a tuple ``(x, y, width, height)`` giving the bounding box of the "
"character at the given *index*."
msgstr ""
"回傳一個元組 ``(x, y, width, height)``，表示給定 *index* 處字元的邊界框。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1725
msgid ""
"Return the name of the element under the point given by *x* and *y*, or the "
"empty string if no element is present at that location."
msgstr ""
"回傳位於 *x* 和 *y* 所指定點下方的元素名稱；若該位置沒有任何元素，則回傳空字"
"串。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1730
msgid ""
"Force validation of the entry and return ``True`` if validation succeeded, "
"and ``False`` otherwise."
msgstr "強制驗證此 Entry，若驗證成功則回傳 ``True``，否則回傳 ``False``。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1736
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Frame` widget, a container used to group and lay out other "
"widgets. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Frame` and inherits "
"the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Frame` 元件是用來將其他元件分組並進行版面配置的容器。它是 :class:"
"`tkinter.Frame` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1744
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Label` widget, displays a textual label and/or image. It is the "
"themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Label` and inherits the common widget "
"methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Label` 元件會顯示文字標籤和/或圖片。它是 :class:`tkinter.Label` "
"的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1751
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Labelframe` widget, a container that draws a border and a title "
"label around its contents. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter."
"LabelFrame` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Labelframe` 元件是一個容器，會在其內容周圍繪製邊框與標題標籤。它"
"是 :class:`tkinter.LabelFrame` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用"
"元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1759
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Menubutton` widget, displays a textual label and/or image, and "
"pops up a menu when pressed. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter."
"Menubutton` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Menubutton` 元件會顯示文字標籤和/或圖片，並在被按下時彈出選單。它"
"是 :class:`tkinter.Menubutton` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用"
"元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1767
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`OptionMenu` widget, a :class:`Menubutton` that pops up a menu of "
"mutually exclusive choices. *variable* is the variable that tracks the "
"currently selected value, *default* is the value to set initially, and "
"*values* are the entries to display in the menu. A *command* keyword "
"argument may be given to specify a callable that is invoked with the "
"selected value whenever the selection changes; the *style* keyword argument "
"sets the style used by the underlying menubutton; the *direction* keyword "
"argument sets where the menu is posted relative to the menubutton (one of "
"``'above'``, ``'below'`` (the default), ``'left'``, ``'right'`` or "
"``'flush'``); and the *name* keyword argument sets the Tk widget name."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`OptionMenu` 元件是一個 :class:`Menubutton`，會彈出一份互斥選項的"
"選單。*variable* 是用來追蹤目前所選數值的變數，*default* 是初始要設定的值，"
"而 *values* 則是要顯示在選單中的項目。可以給定 *command* 關鍵字引數，指定一個"
"可呼叫物件，每當選擇變更時，就會以所選的值來叫用它；*style* 關鍵字引數用來設"
"定底層 menubutton 所使用的樣式；而 *name* 關鍵字引數則用來設定 Tk 元件名稱。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1782
msgid ""
"Replace the entries of the menu with *values*. If *default* is given, also "
"set it as the current value of the *variable*."
msgstr ""
"將選單的項目替換為 *values*。若有給定 *default*，也會將其設為 *variable* 的目"
"前值。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1788
msgid "Destroy this widget and its associated menu."
msgstr "銷毀此元件及其關聯的選單。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1790
msgid "Added support for the *name* keyword argument."
msgstr "新增了對 *name* 關鍵字引數的支援。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1797
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Panedwindow` widget, displays a number of subwindows stacked "
"either vertically or horizontally. The user may adjust the relative sizes of "
"the subwindows by dragging the sash between panes. It is the themed "
"counterpart of :class:`tkinter.PanedWindow` and inherits the common widget "
"methods from :class:`Widget`, as well as the :meth:`!add` and :meth:`!panes` "
"methods from :class:`tkinter.PanedWindow`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Panedwindow` 元件會顯示多個垂直或水平堆疊的子視窗。使用者可以透過"
"拖曳窗格之間的分隔條（sash）來調整子視窗的相對大小。它是 :class:`tkinter."
"PanedWindow` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法，以及 :"
"class:`tkinter.PanedWindow` 的 :meth:`!add` 和 :meth:`!panes` 方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1807
msgid ""
"Insert a pane containing *child* at the position *pos*. *pos* is either the "
"string ``'end'``, an integer index, or the name of a managed subwindow. If "
"*child* is already managed by the paned window, move it to the specified "
"position. Any keyword arguments set pane options."
msgstr ""
"在位置 *pos* 插入一個包含 *child* 的窗格。*pos* 可以是字串 ``'end'``、整數索"
"引，或是受管理子視窗的名稱。若 *child* 已由該 paned window 管理，則將其移動到"
"指定位置。任何關鍵字引數都會用來設定窗格選項。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1816
msgid ""
"Remove *child*, which may be either an integer index or the name of a "
"managed subwindow, from the panes."
msgstr "從窗格中移除 *child*，*child* 可以是整數索引，或是受管理子視窗的名稱。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1826
msgid ""
"Query or modify the options of the specified *pane*, where *pane* is either "
"an integer index or the name of a managed subwindow. If no arguments are "
"given, return a dictionary of the pane option values. If *option* is "
"specified, return the value of that option. Otherwise, set the options given "
"as keyword arguments to their corresponding values."
msgstr ""
"查詢或修改指定 *pane* 的選項，*pane* 可以是整數索引，或是受管理子視窗的名稱。"
"若未給定任何引數，則回傳一個包含窗格選項值的字典。若指定了 *option*，則回傳該"
"選項的值。否則，會將以關鍵字引數給定的選項設為對應的值。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1835
msgid ""
"If *newpos* is specified, set the position of sash number *index* and return "
"its new position. This may adjust the positions of adjacent sashes to ensure "
"that positions are monotonically increasing; positions are also constrained "
"to be between 0 and the total size of the widget. If *newpos* is omitted, "
"return the current position of the sash."
msgstr ""
"若指定了 *newpos*，則設定編號為 *index* 的分隔條（sash）的位置，並回傳其新位"
"置。這可能會調整相鄰分隔條的位置，以確保各位置維持單調遞增；位置也會被限制在 "
"0 到該元件總尺寸之間。若省略 *newpos*，則回傳該分隔條目前的位置。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1845
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Radiobutton` widget, used as part of a group to control a single "
"shared variable by selecting one of several mutually exclusive values. It is "
"the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Radiobutton` and inherits the "
"common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Radiobutton` 元件是群組的一部分，透過從多個互斥的值中選擇其一，來"
"控制單一個共用變數。它是 :class:`tkinter.Radiobutton` 的主題化版本，並繼承"
"了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1852
msgid ""
"Set the option variable to the button's value, select the button, invoke the "
"command associated with the button, and return its result."
msgstr ""
"將選項變數設為該按鈕的值，選取該按鈕，叫用與該按鈕關聯的命令，並回傳其結果。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1858
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Scale` widget, displays a slider that lets the user select a "
"numeric value from a range by moving the slider along a trough. It is the "
"themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Scale` and inherits the common widget "
"methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Scale` 元件會顯示一個滑桿，讓使用者可以透過沿凹槽移動滑桿，從一個"
"範圍中選擇一個數值。它是 :class:`tkinter.Scale` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :"
"class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1865
msgid ""
"Modify or query the widget options, like :meth:`Widget.configure <tkinter."
"Misc.configure>`. In addition, this method clips the ``from`` and ``to`` "
"values so that the current value stays within the range defined by them."
msgstr ""
"修改或查詢元件選項，類似於 :meth:`Widget.configure <tkinter.Misc."
"configure>`。此外，此方法會裁切 ``from`` 和 ``to`` 的值，使目前的值維持在它們"
"所定義的範圍之內。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1870
msgid ""
"Now returns the configuration value, like :meth:`Widget.configure <tkinter."
"Misc.configure>`."
msgstr ""
"現在會回傳設定值，類似於 :meth:`Widget.configure <tkinter.Misc.configure>`。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1877
msgid ""
"Return the current value of the scale. If *x* and *y* are given, return the "
"value corresponding to the pixel coordinate *x*, *y* instead."
msgstr ""
"回傳該 Scale 目前的值。若有給定 *x* 和 *y*，則改為回傳對應於像素座標 *x*、"
"*y* 的值。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1884
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Scrollbar` widget, controls the viewport of an associated "
"scrollable widget such as a :class:`Treeview`, :class:`Entry` or :class:"
"`tkinter.Text`. It is the themed counterpart of :class:`tkinter.Scrollbar` "
"and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`, as well as the :"
"meth:`!set` and :meth:`!get` methods from :class:`tkinter.Scrollbar`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Scrollbar` 元件用來控制相關聯的可捲動元件（例如 :class:"
"`Treeview`、:class:`Entry` 或 :class:`tkinter.Text`）的可視範圍。它是 :class:"
"`tkinter.Scrollbar` 的主題化版本，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法，以"
"及 :class:`tkinter.Scrollbar` 的 :meth:`!set` 和 :meth:`!get` 方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1894
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Separator` widget, displays a horizontal or vertical separator "
"line. It has no direct counterpart in :mod:`tkinter` and inherits the common "
"widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Separator` 元件會顯示一條水平或垂直的分隔線。它在 :mod:`tkinter` "
"中沒有直接對應的元件，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1902
msgid ""
"Ttk :class:`Sizegrip` widget, displays a grip that allows the user to resize "
"the containing toplevel window by pressing and dragging the grip, typically "
"placed in the bottom-right corner. It has no direct counterpart in :mod:"
"`tkinter` and inherits the common widget methods from :class:`Widget`."
msgstr ""
"Ttk :class:`Sizegrip` 元件會顯示一個把手，讓使用者可以透過按下並拖曳該把手，"
"來調整其所在頂層視窗的大小，通常放置在右下角。它在 :mod:`tkinter` 中沒有直接"
"對應的元件，並繼承了 :class:`Widget` 的通用元件方法。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1911
msgid ""
"A :class:`Frame` containing a :class:`Scale` and a :class:`Label` that shows "
"the scale's current value. *variable* is the :class:`~tkinter.IntVar` "
"tracked by the scale (one is created if it is not given), and *from_* and "
"*to* define the range of the scale."
msgstr ""
"一個包含 :class:`Scale` 和 :class:`Label` 的 :class:`Frame`，:class:`Label` "
"用來顯示該 Scale 目前的值。*variable* 是該 Scale 所追蹤的 :class:`~tkinter."
"IntVar`\\ （若未給定，則會建立一個），而 *from_* 和 *to* 則定義了該 Scale 的"
"範圍。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1919
msgid ""
"Destroy this widget and remove the trace callback registered on the "
"associated variable."
msgstr "銷毀此元件，並移除註冊在相關聯變數上的追蹤回呼。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1925
msgid ""
"Alias of :class:`Labelframe`, kept for naming compatibility with :class:"
"`tkinter.LabelFrame`."
msgstr ""
":class:`Labelframe` 的別名，為了與 :class:`tkinter.LabelFrame` 保持命名相容性"
"而保留。"

#: ../../library/tkinter.ttk.rst:1931
msgid ""
"Alias of :class:`Panedwindow`, kept for naming compatibility with :class:"
"`tkinter.PanedWindow`."
msgstr ""
":class:`Panedwindow` 的別名，為了與 :class:`tkinter.PanedWindow` 保持命名相容"
"性而保留。"

